128 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Politeknik Negeri Malang \(POLINEMA\) is a vocational higher education institution located in Malang, Indonesia. One of the long-standing departments is the Accounting Department, which was established in 1986. The establishment of the department received assistance from The Australian Project. Since November 2004 Universitas Brawijaya Polytechnic has obtained an independent status to become State Polytechnic of Malang. In 2022, several study programs in Polinema have obtained an international accreditaton from ASIC, one of them is Master of Applied Study Program in Accounting Information Systems \(Magister Terapan Sistem Informasi Akuntansi-MTSIA\).)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
129 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In 2022, the MTSIA has held the 1st TREASURE \(International Management, Accounting and Business Tournament\) competition with the theme "Capturing the Technology for Today's Management, Accounting, and Business". Participants compete with each other and argue regarding the quality and capability of using information system technology in the accounting field in the Industrial Revolution Era 4.0.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In 2023, the MTSIA continued organizing this tournament to foster discussions on current issues in Accounting, Management, and Business. The competition embraced the theme "Revolutionizing Accounting, Economy, Business, and Management: The Global Technology Challenge," encouraging young professionals in the business world to collaboratively explore, analyze, and discuss the evolving landscape of accounting technology. The aim was not to create anxiety about the future but to prepare participants to seize emerging opportunities with confidence and readiness.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
