/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The TREASURE 2025 International Management, Accounting, and Business Tournament emerged from a collective recognition of the urgent need for interdisciplinary approaches to sustainability challenges. The competition was conceived to address the growing complexity of global environmental and economic issues that cannot be solved through single-disciplinary perspectives.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
146 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The organizers identified a critical gap in traditional educational and business frameworks. Many young professionals and students were found to be working within siloed approaches, lacking the holistic understanding needed to create truly transformative solutions. TREASURE was designed to bridge this gap, providing a platform for emerging talents to demonstrate how integrated management, accounting, and business strategies can drive sustainable innovation.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
147 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The competition reflects the evolving landscape of global business, where sustainability is no longer a peripheral concern but a core strategic imperative. By challenging participants to develop practical, interdisciplinary solutions for everyday life, TREASURE aims to cultivate a new young generation who can reimagine economic systems, reduce waste, and create value through innovative circular approaches. The 2025 edition builds upon previous years' successes, expanding its scope and deepening its commitment to fostering ground-breaking solutions that address the most pressing sustainability challenges of our time.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
